WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.040 --> 00:00:03.110
Every strategy on Strategya.pro already made

2
00:00:03.110 --> 00:00:05.110
its decision at the close,

3
00:00:05.110 --> 00:00:07.640
in cash, long, or short.

4
00:00:07.640 --> 00:00:09.420
The hard part is not the decision,

5
00:00:09.420 --> 00:00:10.940
it is doing what the rule says

6
00:00:10.940 --> 00:00:13.340
when you do not feel like it.

7
00:00:13.340 --> 00:00:15.220
That is what automation is for.

8
00:00:15.220 --> 00:00:16.790
You do not need to be a trader,

9
00:00:16.790 --> 00:00:18.760
and you do not need TradingView.

10
00:00:18.760 --> 00:00:20.070
You need the card,

11
00:00:20.070 --> 00:00:21.920
and one of three paths.

12
00:00:21.920 --> 00:00:23.760
Pick how much you want to automate.

13
00:00:23.760 --> 00:00:24.760
By hand.

14
00:00:24.760 --> 00:00:26.810
After the close, open the Catalog,

15
00:00:26.810 --> 00:00:28.420
read the card, and place the

16
00:00:28.420 --> 00:00:30.840
order yourself on your exchange.

17
00:00:30.840 --> 00:00:32.420
Nothing extra to pay,

18
00:00:32.420 --> 00:00:35.340
just never act on an amber or red card.

19
00:00:35.340 --> 00:00:36.840
With Signum.

20
00:00:36.840 --> 00:00:38.800
Signum is an execution platform.

21
00:00:38.800 --> 00:00:41.510
You connect your exchange to it with API keys,

22
00:00:41.510 --> 00:00:42.840
which stay in Signum,

23
00:00:42.840 --> 00:00:44.160
and create one bot per

24
00:00:44.160 --> 00:00:46.520
strategy with a fixed capital.

25
00:00:46.520 --> 00:00:48.960
The bot places the orders.

26
00:00:48.960 --> 00:00:52.600
Strategya itself never sends orders to any exchange.

27
00:00:52.600 --> 00:00:54.560
Signum has its own monthly price

28
00:00:54.560 --> 00:00:56.380
and its own tutorial videos.

29
00:00:56.380 --> 00:00:58.240
With your AI assistant.

30
00:00:58.240 --> 00:01:00.600
This is the path we use ourselves.

31
00:01:00.600 --> 00:01:01.600
Step 1.

32
00:01:01.600 --> 00:01:04.140
Connect the Strategya connector in your assistant.

33
00:01:04.140 --> 00:01:06.100
In Claude, that is settings,

34
00:01:06.100 --> 00:01:08.520
connectors, add a custom connector with

35
00:01:08.520 --> 00:01:11.540
the address strategya.pro slash MCP,

36
00:01:11.540 --> 00:01:14.880
and sign in with your Strategya account.

37
00:01:14.880 --> 00:01:17.440
It reads exactly what your plan includes,

38
00:01:17.440 --> 00:01:19.680
nothing more, and it can only read.

39
00:01:19.680 --> 00:01:21.810
The products, the Catalog,

40
00:01:21.810 --> 00:01:23.640
the Summary, the KPIs,

41
00:01:23.640 --> 00:01:25.080
and the signal.

42
00:01:25.080 --> 00:01:26.120
Step 2.

43
00:01:26.120 --> 00:01:27.120
Ask it.

44
00:01:27.120 --> 00:01:29.770
Find the position of BTC 1D today.

45
00:01:29.770 --> 00:01:32.800
It answers from the same signal as the card.

46
00:01:32.800 --> 00:01:33.800
Step 3.

47
00:01:33.800 --> 00:01:36.340
To act, connect Signum's connector too,

48
00:01:36.340 --> 00:01:37.760
and schedule a routine,

49
00:01:37.760 --> 00:01:40.390
a task that runs every day after the close,

50
00:01:40.390 --> 00:01:41.800
with this template.

51
00:01:41.800 --> 00:01:45.020
Choose your strategy, and the template fills itself in.

52
00:01:45.020 --> 00:01:47.560
Copy it, paste it into the routine,

53
00:01:47.560 --> 00:01:49.440
and put in your bot's ID.

54
00:01:49.440 --> 00:01:50.500
Read the signal.

55
00:01:50.500 --> 00:01:51.900
If it is expired,

56
00:01:51.900 --> 00:01:52.640
stop.

57
00:01:52.640 --> 00:01:53.920
Compare what the bot holds

58
00:01:53.920 --> 00:01:55.320
with what the card says.

59
00:01:55.320 --> 00:01:57.240
If they match, do nothing.

60
00:01:57.240 --> 00:01:59.180
If they differ, close first,

61
00:01:59.180 --> 00:02:02.680
confirm the pair, then open with the fixed capital.

62
00:02:02.680 --> 00:02:04.250
Log one line.

63
00:02:04.250 --> 00:02:05.910
If anything is unclear,

64
00:02:05.910 --> 00:02:07.300
stop and report.

65
00:02:07.300 --> 00:02:10.120
The assistant reads, Signum executes,

66
00:02:10.120 --> 00:02:12.360
you set capital, and stops.

67
00:02:12.360 --> 00:02:14.560
These are the rules we use ourselves,

68
00:02:14.560 --> 00:02:15.880
with our own money.

69
00:02:15.880 --> 00:02:17.520
Fixed capital per bot,

70
00:02:17.520 --> 00:02:20.160
an external stop on the exchange.

71
00:02:20.160 --> 00:02:22.280
Confirm the pair before every order.

72
00:02:22.280 --> 00:02:24.570
No re-entry after a manual stop.

73
00:02:24.570 --> 00:02:26.720
An expired card is not a signal,

74
00:02:26.720 --> 00:02:29.840
and keys stay in the exchange and in Signum,

75
00:02:29.840 --> 00:02:31.590
never in the assistant,

76
00:02:31.590 --> 00:02:33.560
and never in Strategya.

77
00:02:33.560 --> 00:02:34.800
Tested with Claude.

78
00:02:34.800 --> 00:02:37.490
Any assistant that supports MCP connectors should

79
00:02:37.490 --> 00:02:39.200
be able to read the signals.

80
00:02:39.200 --> 00:02:40.880
We have not tested others.

81
00:02:40.880 --> 00:02:43.060
The connector never places orders.

82
00:02:43.060 --> 00:02:44.540
The card decides.

83
00:02:44.540 --> 00:02:46.200
You execute.

84
00:02:46.200 --> 00:02:47.960
Automation just makes sure you do.

85
00:02:47.960 --> 00:02:50.410
Everything here is a simulated backtest.

86
00:02:50.410 --> 00:02:53.680
Not real performance, and not investment advice.

